<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lankan forex market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Sri Lankan forex market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sri Lankan foreign exchange market is closed on Thursday for a Buddhist holiday. The market will reopen on Friday.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, the rupee closed a shade weaker at 56.45 to the dollar after opening at 56.40.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
